      "location": "Top of the page, approx. (10, 45)",
      "fact": "The chart title reads 'Increasing Production at Factory F from 2018 to 2023'. This text explicitly describes an increasing trend."
    },
    {
      "location": "Plot area, approx. (250, 300) to (2100, 650)",
